<!--
    Hexfall: icons. Cut for this theme on a 24 grid: 2.5px strokes drawn as outlines, 45 degree cuts, hexagon rings
    where a round glyph would sit (search lens, notifications, random), so they read as the same family as the
    cut-corner panels. None are traced from the game.
    IconMainMenu is the theme's own mark: a hexagon ring broken at the top right with a shard dropping out of the
    gap (art/mark.svg; no spire, no owner mark).
    Playnite's menu icons keep their icofont glyphs; only their hardcoded colors move onto theme brushes.
-->
